<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.54.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.54.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.54.0 (2026-11-25): Correction of my own closure record in 1.53.0. There the mission outcome was written as free text, but BRSF's T-Box makes hasMissionOutcome an object property whose values are Out_InFlight, Out_Achieved and Out_Abandoned, and its shapes require a ClosureReport that names the mission. This version adds the formal outcome Out_Achieved and a ClosureReport record. Out_Achieved is the nearest value because the vocabulary has no partial value; the partial result stays stated in the outcome text of 1.53.0, in the report and in the report summary below (five of six objectives met, traced examples 27 of 37). The text value from 1.53.0 stays in the history because register files only add statements; this is reported to BRSF as a vocabulary gap. Owner confirmed the closure on 2026-11-25 11:41.""" .

ex:Mission11 backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved .

ex:ClosureReport11 a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    rdfs:label "Closure report: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    backlog:closesForMission ex:Mission11 ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-11-25T09:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:closureCommittedAt "a00e654425d76e31f72af215b25534af508f2629" ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "Partial achievement. Chapters 10 and 11 carry 37 code examples in one piece each, identical on slide and page. Five of six objectives met (differences 0, split boxes 0, examples run 37, verdicts 24, tools 3). Traced examples are 27 of 37, so that target was missed; ten examples name no book block. The full account is in 07-lineage/CLOSURE_REPORT_sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage_Lineage11_v1_0_0.md." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective ex:Obj11_TracedExamples , ex:Obj11_SlidePageDiffs , ex:Obj11_SplitCodeSlides , ex:Obj11_PageExamplesRun , ex:Obj11_ReviewVerdicts , ex:Obj11_NeutralTools .
